From: Shameer Kolothum <shameerali.kolothum.thodi@huawei.com>
Date: Tue, 19 Jul 2022 16:51:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 0912/1646] [Backport] crypto: hisilicon/qm: Move the QM header
 to include/linux

mainline inclusion
from mainline-v5.18-rc1
commit ff5812e00d5e7bdeae68784d99686eff67896931
category: feature
bugzilla: https://gitee.com/openeuler/kernel/issues/I5AFY1

Reference: https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/commit/?id=ff5812e00d5e7bdeae68784d99686eff67896931

--------------------------------

Since we are going to introduce VFIO PCI HiSilicon ACC driver for live
migration in subsequent patches, move the ACC QM header file to a
common include dir.

