Signed-off-by: Jialin Zhang <zhangjialin11@huawei.com>
---
 drivers/crypto/hisilicon/hpre/hpre.h                         | 2 +-
 drivers/crypto/hisilicon/qm.c                                | 2 +-
 drivers/crypto/hisilicon/sec2/sec.h                          | 2 +-
 drivers/crypto/hisilicon/sgl.c                               | 2 +-
